===Verb===
{{ru-verb|надува́ть|impf|pf=наду́ть}}

# to [[inflate]], to [[puff out]], to [[blow up]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''надува́ть''' [[шина|ши́ну]]|to blow/pump up a tyre/tire}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''надува́ть''' [[возду́шный]] [[ша́рик]]|to inflate (blow up) a balloon}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''надува́ть''' [[спаса́тельный]] [[жиле́т]]|to inflate the life jacket}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[надува́ть щёки]]|to [[be puffed up]]; [[give oneself airs]]}}
# to [[drift]] ''(by wind)''
# to [[give]] someone [[a]] [[chill]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[dupe]], to [[swindle]]

